"Face ID 需要工程里配 NSFaceIDUsageDescription；不填也不会崩，只是拿不到结果。" = "Face ID needs NSFaceIDUsageDescription in the project. Without it nothing crashes, you just get no result.";
"SYSTEM 合计" = "SYSTEM gesamt";
"iOS 沙箱不允许 App fork 进程、也不允许执行 App 外的可执行文件。Minis 之所以能在手机上跑 shell，是把 iSH 内核和 Alpine rootfs 一起编译进了 App。本工程不带内核，所以终端 / radare2 / MITM 走局域网节点，其余全部本地。" = "The iOS sandbox forbids forking processes or running executables outside the app. Minis can run a shell on the phone because it compiles the iSH kernel and an Alpine rootfs into the app. This build ships without a kernel, so terminal / radare2 / MITM go through a LAN node; everything else is local.";
